# ── The specification is not Prettier's to format ────────────────────────────
#
# Running Prettier over docs/ rewrites every hand-aligned Markdown table in the
# repository -- ADRs, the invariant registry, the domain model -- producing a diff of
# hundreds of lines that changes no meaning whatsoever.
#
# That is bad anywhere. It is worse here: `.github/CODEOWNERS` marks `docs/domain/` and
# the ADRs as Tier 2, the paths a conformance review must read at full depth. A formatter
# that rewrites them wholesale makes every real change to those files unreviewable,
# because the signal is buried in reflowed pipes.
#
# Prose is reviewed by reading it. Prettier formats the code.
*.md
docs/

